							"string" : "Old-style {{gtClass:WeakAnnouncementSubscription}}s moved into a mixed registry, for example when an announcer switches registries after it already has subscriptions, keep their global entry and therefore the old behaviour; the registry reports such a mix through {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistry>>#hasLeakProneSubscriptionMix}}."
